  "decision_conditions": [
    "&lt;div&gt;The proposed development by reason of scale, siting, design, bulk and mass would be an undesirable addition, significantly impacting the existing character of the semi-detached dwelling. The addition of the front and side extension would create a staggered roof form that would be visible from various points of Hitherfield Road and would significantly impact the existing pattern of development and symmetry of the semi-detached dwelling. The site would appear as overdeveloped and is inconsistent with the surrounding context, notably given the location of the application site within the Becontree Estate. As such, the proposed development is contrary to:&lt;br&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;span pt=&quot;&quot; sans&quot;,=&quot;&quot; sans-serif;&quot;=&quot;&quot; style=&quot;font-size: 10.5pt;&quot;&gt;- National Planning Policy Framework&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;&amp;nbsp;(NPPF) (MHCLG, 2024)&lt;o:p&gt;&lt;/o:p&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p class=&quot;MsoNormal&quot;&gt;&lt;span pt=&quot;&quot; sans&quot;,=&quot;&quot; sans-serif;&quot;=&quot;&quot; style=&quot;font-size: 10.5pt; line-height: 14.98px;&quot;&gt;- Policy D4 of the London Plan (March 2021)&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p class=&quot;MsoNormal&quot;&gt;&lt;span pt=&quot;&quot; sans&quot;,=&quot;&quot; sans-serif;&quot;=&quot;&quot; style=&quot;font-size: 10.5pt; line-height: 14.98px;&quot;&gt;- The Residential Extensions and Alterations Supplementary Planning Document (February 2012)&lt;o:p&gt;&lt;/o:p&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p class=&quot;MsoNormal&quot;&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-weight: 700;&quot;&gt;-&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span pt=&quot;&quot; sans&quot;,=&quot;&quot; sans-serif;&quot;=&quot;&quot; style=&quot;font-size: 10.5pt;&quot;&gt;Policies SP2, DMD1, DMD4 and DMD5 of&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;The London Borough of Barking and Dagenham’s Local Plan 2037: (September 2024)&lt;/p&gt;&lt;/div&gt;"
